<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal">Hi<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 12pt;">[Insert Name]</span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">,</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">The American Red Cross is grateful for the opportunity to
partner with <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;school
name&gt;</span> students, as they help carry out the Red Cross mission year
after year. Their contributions are meaningful and valuable to college and job
recruiters, as well. We’re happy to share a resource that provides your
students with suggestions on how they can explain their lifesaving work on
their resumes, college and job applications or anywhere else that supports
their college and career search. <o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal">Check out the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/hosting-a-blood-drive/donating-blood-as-a-community-service.html">High
School &amp; College Student Guide for Sharing Your Biomedical Services Impact</a>
and encourage your students to use this great tool to highlight the value that
they provide, not only by helping us fulfill our lifesaving mission and serve
our communities, but also for themselves as they are building new skills,
demonstrating ambition, and helping to fill in their resume.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal">You’ll find content within the guide for Red Cross volunteer
roles including:<o:p></o:p></p>

<ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Blood donors<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:
     auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Blood Donor Ambassadors<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:
     auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Blood Program Leaders<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:
     auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">American Red Cross scholarship recipients <o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Other biomedical volunteer positions<o:p></o:p></li>
</ul>

<p class="MsoNormal">Thank you for supporting our lifesaving mission and helping
raise up the next generation of humanitarians. We hope this guide will help
students demonstrate the impact of their lifesaving achievements!<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal">Sincerely,</p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102); font-size: 12pt;">[Insert Name]</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
